---
// Real imagery with a scripted configuration demonstration, never a live terminal.
---
<div class="engineering-scene" data-engineering-scene>
  <img class="engineer-photo" src="/images/hero.webp" alt="Ethiopian technology engineer working in a data center" width="1600" height="1000" fetchpriority="high" />
  <div class="scene-shade"></div>
  <div class="scene-kicker"><span class="status-dot"></span> IDEAS INTO INFRASTRUCTURE <span>01 / ET</span></div>
  <div class="terminal-window" aria-label="Illustrative data center configuration">
    <div class="terminal-bar"><span class="terminal-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>all in one cyber security / infrastructure</span><span>⌘</span></div>
    <div class="terminal-body" aria-hidden="true"><p class="terminal-comment"># Addis Ababa · systems overview</p><p class="terminal-line"><span class="terminal-prompt">❯ </span><span class="terminal-command">cluster health --all</span><span class="terminal-cursor">_</span></p><p class="terminal-result">✓ Network, security and compute ready</p></div>
    <p class="visually-hidden">Illustrative systems overview showing network, security and compute ready.</p>
    <div class="server-status"><span><i></i> Network</span><span><i></i> Security</span><span><i></i> Compute</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="scene-caption"><span>Human expertise.<br/><strong>Precisely configured.</strong></span><span class="scene-seal" aria-hidden="true">AIO</span></div>
</div>
